grid-mobile-cloudflare/tools/shots/
# _scratch 目录内的垃圾（备份/调试/中间产物）；mkdeploy.py 是构建工具，单独保留
grid-mobile-cloudflare/worker/_scratch/deploy.js.*
grid-mobile-cloudflare/worker/_scratch/*.bak
grid-mobile-cloudflare/worker/_scratch/*.log
grid-mobile-cloudflare/worker/_scratch/names.json
grid-mobile-cloudflare/worker/_scratch/names.txt
